# Styles shared by the sample templates: the base typography, so that a new template of this folder converts before it
# has styles of its own. Each template brings its own look in its <name>.styles.stxt, which sets these four again and
# wins over them, so they change none of the templates here.
Styles (dev.stxt.pdf):
	For element: Document
		Typography:
			Font: IBM Plex Sans
			Size: 10
			Line height: 14
			Color: #1E2328
